⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
258 calories 24g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

High Protein Pumpkin Pie Blizzard 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 145 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free @fairlife Milk
- 40-45g Monk Fruit Sweetener (or any sugar substitute)
- 60g canned pumpkin
- 2.5g (½ tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 2g (½ tsp) pumpkin pie spice
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 1 Mini Pie crust (100 calories - can sub with 100 calories of any kind of pie crust)
258 cal 28g C, 5g F, 24g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if powdery
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the pie crust
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

